
*User saves a file using File > Save As Dialogue"
Goal: File Save As
.Goal: Select File Button
..Look at <file-button>
..Point to <file-button>
..Cognitive_processor verify cursor over <file-button>
..Click <file-button>
..Ignore <file-button>
.Goal: Select Save As Button
..Look at <save-as>
..Point to <save-as>
..Cognitive_processor verify cursor over <save-as>
..Click <save-as>
..Ignore <save-as>
.Goal: Enter File Name
..Think of <file-name>
..Look at <file name field>
..Hands to keyboard
..Type <file-name>
..Cognitive_processor verify <file-name> is correct
..Keystroke Enter
..Ignore  <file name field>
   